      "title": "Amcor to Report September 2026-End Results: What to Expect?",
      "summary": "Amcor is scheduled to report September 2026 quarter results with expected revenues of $5.83B and EPS of 96 cents, representing modest 1.4% revenue growth and 1% earnings growth. While e-commerce growth and favorable currency impacts are expected to provide support, the company faces headwinds from weak consumer demand, resin shortages, raw material volatility, and divestitures that may offset gains from the Berry Global merger. The company carries a Zacks Rank of 4 with an Earnings ESP of +1.17%, suggesting limited likelihood of an earnings beat.",
